{"v":1,"slug":"video","room":"films","bytes":1159601323,"items":[{"id":"film-selena-and-obsidia-video-trailer-001-3994447231709070185","title":"Day of Enders","collection":"video","chars":["selena","obsidia","guinevere","vexana","layla","fanny"],"pair":"selena-obsidia","canon":"official","tags":["trailer","cinematic","singularity","new skins"],"kind":"cinematic-trailer","year":2026,"date":"2026-09-26","desc":"The crisis in the Singularity is far from over. Obsidia, the mastermind behind the Enders, quietly reveals herself while the Aspirants fight with all their might, and Selena watches from a rooftop in her school uniform.","video":{"src":"video/films/film-selena-and-obsidia-video-trailer-001-3994447231709070185/video.mp4","poster":"video/films/film-selena-and-obsidia-video-trailer-001-3994447231709070185/poster.webp","w":1920,"h":808,"dur":180.8},"thumb":"video/films/film-selena-and-obsidia-video-trailer-001-3994447231709070185/thumb.webp","backdrop":"video/films/film-selena-and-obsidia-video-trailer-001-3994447231709070185/backdrop.webp","c":"#765978","fps":24.0,"bytes":145190050},{"id":"film-selena-and-obsidia-video-selena-video","title":"The Pawn's Gambit","collection":"video","chars":["selena","obsidia"],"pair":"selena-obsidia","canon":"official","tags":["character trailer","selena"],"kind":"character-trailer","desc":"Selena is a student at Selrick Academy who cannot stand early mornings, the sun in her eyes or taking orders. She says she is no one's doll.","video":{"src":"video/films/film-selena-and-obsidia-video-selena-video/video.mp4","poster":"video/films/film-selena-and-obsidia-video-selena-video/poster.webp","w":1920,"h":1080,"dur":69.19},"thumb":"video/films/film-selena-and-obsidia-video-selena-video/thumb.webp","backdrop":"video/films/film-selena-and-obsidia-video-selena-video/backdrop.webp","c":"#413964","fps":30.0,"bytes":86648690},{"id":"film-selena-and-obsidia-video-obsidia-001-3997406762701005025","title":"The Queen's Endgame","collection":"video